cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the dataset and the associated BOID research where relevant."
title: "AiCumene EEG-BCI Sleep–Wake Dataset"
type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: "Bernadotte"
    given-names: "Alexandra"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8835-6583"
  - family-names: "Menshikov"
    given-names: "Ivan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9987-4060"

abstract: "A dataset in two components. (1) A public synthetic sleep-EEG benchmark of 45 synthetic recordings with sleep-stage hypnograms, produced by per-recording oscillator resynthesis of Sleep-EDF Expanded (Sleep Cassette; PhysioNet) — a phase-randomised surrogate that preserves each source recording's oscillatory structure; all 45 are released publicly under CC BY-NC 4.0 with attribution to the Sleep-EDF source. (2) 40 real AiCumene wearable-EEG recordings, held under controlled access and available to qualified researchers on request. The dataset supports research on Brain Oscillator Intrinsic Dimension (BOID), sleep-stage-dependent oscillator dimensionality, and Hankel/MSSA analysis."

